{
  "id": "the-simpsons---6x03---another-simpsons-clip-show",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 6x03 - Another Simpsons Clip Show",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 6x03 - Another Simpsons Clip Show.en.srt",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-19T20:05:59.725Z",
  "lineCount": 285,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "Another Simpsons Clip Show",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 3638,
      "endMs": 5173
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "This romance is so full of heartfelt passion.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 34340,
      "endMs": 37577
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "I can really identify with this corn-fed heroine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 37744,
      "endMs": 41348
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Homer, are you awake?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 41582,
      "endMs": 43250
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "This is important. Give me some sign you're awake.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43417,
      "endMs": 45687
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Wake up! What's wrong?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 46688,
      "endMs": 48990
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "House run away? Dog's on fire?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 49191,
      "endMs": 51260
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Homie, do you think that the romance has gone out of our lives?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 51427,
      "endMs": 54864
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Wake up!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 55732,
      "endMs": 57767
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Marge, it's 3 a.m., and I worked all day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 57934,
      "endMs": 60437
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "It's 9:30 p.m., and you spent your whole Saturday...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 60671,
      "endMs": 63040
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "...drinking beer in Maggie's kiddie pool.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 63207,
      "endMs": 65376
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "There you are.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 66411,
      "endMs": 68447
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "Thought you could get away, huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 68613,
      "endMs": 70015
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Homer, young people learn about love from adults.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 71199,
      "endMs": 73434
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "We've been setting a terrible example for our children and the community.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 73601,
      "endMs": 77672
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "I want us to deal with the issues raised by this book.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 77838,
      "endMs": 81609
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "We shouldn't have put a fireplace in the bedroom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84545,
      "endMs": 86880
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "How many times can you laugh at that cat getting hit by the moon?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 118910,
      "endMs": 121913
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "It's a new episode.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 122113,
      "endMs": 123381
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "Not exactly. They pieced it together from old shows.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 123548,
      "endMs": 126184
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "And it seems new to the trusting eyes of impressionable youth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 126350,
      "endMs": 129620
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Really? Ren & Stimpy do it all the time.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 129820,
      "endMs": 132556
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Yes, and when was the last you heard anyone talk about Ren & Stimpy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 132756,
      "endMs": 136126
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "Children, your father and I have fed you and clothed you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 136293,
      "endMs": 139596
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "...but we've neglected something more important.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 139729,
      "endMs": 142432
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "It's time to learn about love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 142632,
      "endMs": 144667
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "No need. We already learned in school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 144868,
      "endMs": 146669
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "This is Fuzzy Bunny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 147036,
      "endMs": 148738
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "About a year ago he noticed his voice was changing. He had terrible acne...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 148938,
      "endMs": 153609
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "...and had fur where there was no fur before. He also noticed Fluffy Bunny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 153776,
      "endMs": 159481
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "Boring.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159715,
      "endMs": 161416
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "Fuzzy went to the park, the ice-cream social, the boat show...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 161617,
      "endMs": 165487
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "...and other wholesome activities. They never ruined their fun...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165654,
      "endMs": 169824
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "...by giving in to their throbbing biological urges.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 169991,
      "endMs": 173194
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Then came the big day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 174596,
      "endMs": 176465
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "Fluffy and Fuzzy got married. That night came the honeymoon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 176632,
      "endMs": 181336
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "She's faking it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 183138,
      "endMs": 184472
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "I mean romance, not love.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 184672,
      "endMs": 187775
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "Mom, romance is dead.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 187975,
      "endMs": 189177
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "It was acquired in a hostile takeover by Hallmark and Disney...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189377,
      "endMs": 192246
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "...homogenized and sold off piece by piece.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192446,
      "endMs": 195049
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "That's not true! Romance is all around us, in our neighborhoods.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 195249,
      "endMs": 199453
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Even at our jobs.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 200687,
      "endMs": 202756
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "All you have to do is think about your most cherished memories.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 212098,
      "endMs": 216302
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "Moe's Tavern. Hello, is Al there?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 217503,
      "endMs": 219638
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "AI? Yeah, Al. Last name, Coholic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219805,
      "endMs": 222441
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Let me check.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 222641,
      "endMs": 223976
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Phone call for Al. Al Coholic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 224176,
      "endMs": 226678
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Jock Strap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226878,
      "endMs": 228880
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "Is I.P. Freely here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229080,
      "endMs": 230815
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Hey, is there a Butts here? Seymour Butts?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 231016,
      "endMs": 234452
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "Homer Sexual! Mike Rotch!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 235220,
      "endMs": 237588
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "Amanda Huggenkiss!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 237822,
      "endMs": 239357
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "Hugh Jass. Ivana Tinkle.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 239557,
      "endMs": 241726
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "I'm a stupid moron with an ugly face and a big butt...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 241926,
      "endMs": 245062
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "...and my butt smells and I like to kiss my own butt.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245296,
      "endMs": 248899
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "No, no!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 250133,
      "endMs": 251434
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "No, ask your heart what its fondest desire is.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 251601,
      "endMs": 255638
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Chocolate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 258207,
      "endMs": 260309
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Invisible cola.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261176,
      "endMs": 263211
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "Forbidden donut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 263979,
      "endMs": 266147
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "No, think about people...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 266177,
      "endMs": 268113
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "...about moments in your life that have been very romantic.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 268280,
      "endMs": 272017
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Oh, okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272218,
      "endMs": 273219
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "That's not the idea at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 276322,
      "endMs": 280027
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "Okay. Well, this story isn't ideal. I've never told it to you before.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280761,
      "endMs": 286201
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "I got a thoughtless birthday present from someone who shall remain nameless.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 286501,
      "endMs": 290773
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "I went to the bowling alley to spite him. Or her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 294210,
      "endMs": 296446
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "I'm awfully sorry. Entirely my fault.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 308260,
      "endMs": 311697
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "It is nice to meet you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 311931,
      "endMs": 313432
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "...Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 314700,
      "endMs": 316102
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "No, no. Homer is my ball's name. I'm Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 316269,
      "endMs": 321075
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Your fingers are slender, so feminine. They're too tapered for this ball.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 327047,
      "endMs": 331852
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "You need something lighter, more delicate.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 332052,
      "endMs": 335255
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "Here, use my ball. No, thank you, Mister... Brunswick.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 335455,
      "endMs": 340180
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "Call me Jacques. Jacques.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 340340,
      "endMs": 342543
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 342743,
      "endMs": 344064
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "May I ask you a bold question?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 345065,
      "endMs": 347147
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Sure. You've never bowled?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 347307,
      "endMs": 349029
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "Never. No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 349189,
      "endMs": 350470
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "No. Then I will teach you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 350671,
      "endMs": 352873
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "I don't want to trouble you. Not at all. I'm a professional.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 353073,
      "endMs": 356116
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Roll the ball, Marge. Let me see your form.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 356316,
      "endMs": 358398
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "All right. But I'm not very good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 358559,
      "endMs": 361481
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "I can hit the one pin, but the rest of them don't even wobble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 364324,
      "endMs": 367648
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "I can help you, Marge. Pick up the ball.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367808,
      "endMs": 369930
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "Pick up Homer. Pick him up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 370170,
      "endMs": 372332
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Now throw. But...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 374454,
      "endMs": 375856
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Throw, damn you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 376056,
      "endMs": 378018
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "You're a very good teacher.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 382342,
      "endMs": 384625
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "Here we are. You didn't have to drop me off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 386026,
      "endMs": 388549
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "But I wanted to.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 388709,
      "endMs": 390070
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "Marge, do you know how beautiful you look in the moonlight?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 390230,
      "endMs": 394154
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Jacques, I'm a married woman. I know, I know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 394314,
      "endMs": 397638
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "My mind says stop, but my heart and my hips cry, \"Proceed!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 397798,
      "endMs": 402963
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "Darling, I want to see you tomorrow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404204,
      "endMs": 406326
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "Meet me tomorrow for brunch. What's brunch?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 406527,
      "endMs": 408649
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "You'd love it. It's not quite breakfast or lunch...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 408889,
      "endMs": 411251
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "...but it comes with a slice of cantaloupe at the end.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411411,
      "endMs": 414334
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "You don't get what you would at breakfast, but you get a good meal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 414535,
      "endMs": 418098
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "He seemed to know a lot about brunch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 418258,
      "endMs": 420420
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "But it turned out he wasn't interested in brunch at all.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 420581,
      "endMs": 423503
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Your laughter is like music but if you laugh at what I say next, I will die.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424945,
      "endMs": 429269
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "For I am about to say something very serious, perhaps shocking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 429429,
      "endMs": 433073
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "Marge, my darling, I want you to meet with me again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 433273,
      "endMs": 436637
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "That doesn't shock me. Away from prying eyes.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436797,
      "endMs": 439880
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "At my apartment, the Fiesta Terrace.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440040,
      "endMs": 443363
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "Marge, speak to me!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 445686,
      "endMs": 447848
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Is Thursday okay?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 448529,
      "endMs": 450410
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Thank goodness I drove down that ironic street.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 463303,
      "endMs": 465706
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "I made the right decision to stay with my Homie, and there was no harm done.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466987,
      "endMs": 471552
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "So if you mentally snip out the part where I already had a husband...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 472713,
      "endMs": 476276
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "...that's my idea of romance.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 476476,
      "endMs": 478719
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "Marge, I want you to stop seeing this Jacques.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478959,
      "endMs": 481842
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "You can let him down gently...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 482002,
      "endMs": 483403
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "...but over the next couple of months, I want you to break it off.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 483564,
      "endMs": 487087
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "Okay, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 487287,
      "endMs": 488849
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "That was a close one, kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 489289,
      "endMs": 490931
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "Okay, Marge. As long as we're traumatizing the kids...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 493453,
      "endMs": 497297
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "...I have a scandalous story of my own.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 497377,
      "endMs": 500340
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Gentlemen, I'd like you to meet your new coworker, Mindy Simmons.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 501421,
      "endMs": 504745
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "She has a degree in engineering or something.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504905,
      "endMs": 506947
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Hi. How's it going?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507107,
      "endMs": 508268
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "Oh, pleased to meet you. Yeah, ditto.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 508468,
      "endMs": 510190
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "Hi.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 510430,
      "endMs": 511672
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "Homer, what's the matter?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515796,
      "endMs": 517477
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "Ain't you never seen a naked chick riding a clam before?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517598,
      "endMs": 520561
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "Gotta go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521642,
      "endMs": 523083
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "I made it the whole day without seeing her again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 527648,
      "endMs": 531451
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "I mean, \"Hello!\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532252,
      "endMs": 534895
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "I guess we'll be going down together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535135,
      "endMs": 537097
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "I mean, getting off togeth... I mean... That's okay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 537297,
      "endMs": 539740
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "I'll just push the button for the stimulator... I mean, elevator.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 539900,
      "endMs": 543503
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Think unsexy thoughts, think unsexy thoughts, think unsexy thoughts.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 543664,
      "endMs": 547027
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "Well, this is my floor.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 554915,
      "endMs": 556476
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "See you tomorrow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 560040,
      "endMs": 561321
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "I tried to avoid her, but we were sent to a nuclear convention together.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561522,
      "endMs": 564845
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "TV's there. Bathroom's there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 570210,
      "endMs": 571812
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "And there's your king-size bed for:",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571972,
      "endMs": 574174
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Hubba-hubba. Stop that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 581501,
      "endMs": 582743
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "I love my wife and family. All I'll use this bed for is sleeping, eating...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583943,
      "endMs": 587346
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "...and maybe building a little fort. That's it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 587506,
      "endMs": 590029
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Homer, I got a really wicked idea that could get us into a lot of trouble.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 590229,
      "endMs": 594954
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Mindy. We have to fight our temptation. No, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 595074,
      "endMs": 599719
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "Let's do it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 599839,
      "endMs": 601440
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "Let's call room service!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601601,
      "endMs": 603402
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "I was doing my best to resist her...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 606206,
      "endMs": 608368
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "...but at dinner, the fortune cookie predicted doom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 608609,
      "endMs": 612252
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "\"You will find happiness with a new love.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 614855,
      "endMs": 617217
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "This was a really nice night, Homer. Yeah, yeah.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 617417,
      "endMs": 621221
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "What's wrong? Oh, yeah, like you don't know.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 623263,
      "endMs": 627027
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "We're gonna have sex.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 627227,
      "endMs": 629990
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Well, we don't have to. Yes, we do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 630190,
      "endMs": 634234
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "The cookie told me so.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 634434,
      "endMs": 636156
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Well, desserts aren't always right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 636396,
      "endMs": 639359
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "But they're so sweet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 639560,
      "endMs": 641041
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "Homer...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 641241,
      "endMs": 642803
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "...you know how I feel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 643564,
      "endMs": 645686
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "So it's up to you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 645926,
      "endMs": 648368
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Look in your heart. I think you'll see what you want.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 648849,
      "endMs": 653053
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "Oh, baby.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 667387,
      "endMs": 669229
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "This was a wonderful idea, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 670070,
      "endMs": 673634
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "What happened to Mindy? Yes, what did happen to her?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 674354,
      "endMs": 677157
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "She hit the bottle hard and lost her job.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 677357,
      "endMs": 679520
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Good. Does anyone else have a love story?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679960,
      "endMs": 683283
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "Yes, I do. And just like your love stories, it's tragic and filled with hurt feelings...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683524,
      "endMs": 687648
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "...and scars that will never heal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687808,
      "endMs": 689489
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "It started, appropriately enough, with an innocent boy...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 689930,
      "endMs": 692492
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "...being embarrassed on Valentine's Day.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 692733,
      "endMs": 695495
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "Poor Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699900,
      "endMs": 702262
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Here you go, Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 703063,
      "endMs": 705025
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "You \"choo-choo-choose\" me? Happy Valentine's.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 706867,
      "endMs": 710631
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "It was an unusually warm February 14th...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 714995,
      "endMs": 717277
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "...so the children walked home without jackets.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 717518,
      "endMs": 719920
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "Can I walk you home, valentine?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 720080,
      "endMs": 723604
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "Sure, I guess.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 723844,
      "endMs": 725205
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "That valentine sure was funny.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725806,
      "endMs": 729009
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Glad you liked it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 729169,
      "endMs": 730651
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "It says \"choo-choo-choose\" me, and there's a picture of a train.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 730811,
      "endMs": 736456
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "Yeah, nice gag.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736617,
      "endMs": 738979
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "So...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741181,
      "endMs": 742743
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "...do you like stuff?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 742983,
      "endMs": 746186
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "The doctor said I wouldn't have so many nosebleeds if I kept my finger out of it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 748749,
      "endMs": 753954
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Well, here's my house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 754194,
      "endMs": 756877
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "Oh, no. It's a package from Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 763524,
      "endMs": 766406
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "A Malibu Stacy convertible!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 768368,
      "endMs": 771131
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "\"Look in the tunk.\" He must mean \"trunk.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 771331,
      "endMs": 774655
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Tickets to the Krusty Anniversary Show!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 777538,
      "endMs": 780220
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "It's the Krusty the Clown 29th Anniversary Show!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 780621,
      "endMs": 783584
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Thank you, thank you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 787748,
      "endMs": 789109
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Lisa, you want a bite of my ice cream? No, thanks.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789509,
      "endMs": 793153
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "Send it this way, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 793393,
      "endMs": 795676
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "Nothing gets chocolate out. See?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 798400,
      "endMs": 801520
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "Now, for my favorite part of the show...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 801680,
      "endMs": 803840
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "What does that say? \"Talk to the audience\"?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804040,
      "endMs": 806920
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "Oh, God, this is always death. All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 807120,
      "endMs": 810880
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Oh, no. Please don't show me with Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 811080,
      "endMs": 813160
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "What's your name, son? Ralph.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 814240,
      "endMs": 816880
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "And is this your girlfriend, Ralph? Yes!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 817120,
      "endMs": 820000
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "I love Lisa Simpson! And when I grow up, I'm going to marry her.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 820200,
      "endMs": 824080
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "No!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 824280,
      "endMs": 826520
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Now, you listen to me! I don't like you! I never liked you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 826720,
      "endMs": 829840
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "The only reason I gave you that valentine...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 830040,
      "endMs": 832000
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "...is because nobody else would!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 832240,
      "endMs": 834280
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "Watch this. You can actually pinpoint the second when his heart rips in half.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 834480,
      "endMs": 838520
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "And now!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839440,
      "endMs": 843040
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "Lisa, not all romances turn out that way.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 846240,
      "endMs": 849240
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "Bart, do you have a love story that doesn't end in heartbreak?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 849480,
      "endMs": 853040
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "Yes, I do.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 853280,
      "endMs": 854720
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "The only girl I ever loved invited me up to the tree house.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 854920,
      "endMs": 858480
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "She had something very important to tell me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 858680,
      "endMs": 861600
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "I'm so happy, I just had to tell someone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 862840,
      "endMs": 866120
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "I have a boyfriend.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 866360,
      "endMs": 867880
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "You won't be needing this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 871240,
      "endMs": 873280
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Wait, that did end in heartbreak.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 882520,
      "endMs": 884920
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "Thanks for opening up old wounds, Ma.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885120,
      "endMs": 887480
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "Well, as Jerry Lee Lewis would say: \"There's a whole lot of frowning going on.\"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 897000,
      "endMs": 903040
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Mom, doesn't any love story have a happy ending?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 906260,
      "endMs": 908620
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "Of course. Remember when...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 908860,
      "endMs": 912700
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "...your Aunt Selma got married?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 912940,
      "endMs": 915740
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "Good. Soon I will kill you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917260,
      "endMs": 919660
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Wait, wait, that's no good.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 919900,
      "endMs": 921340
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "I know. Your grandfather, remember?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 921540,
      "endMs": 924660
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "It started on an outing for dinner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 924860,
      "endMs": 926420
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "Say, I've got a neat idea.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 929100,
      "endMs": 931020
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "Why don't you go in and pick up my mother, and we'll go out to dinner.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 931220,
      "endMs": 934220
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "I'll be back in a jiffy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 934420,
      "endMs": 936940
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "That's not my mother.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 940700,
      "endMs": 941980
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "I'll be back in a jiffy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 942180,
      "endMs": 944580
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "Can I come too?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945740,
      "endMs": 948140
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "They hit it off right away, but there were rivals for the fair lady's hand.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 953420,
      "endMs": 957060
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "My favorite song. This is so nice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957220,
      "endMs": 961300
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "I can't remember when I've felt this young.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 961460,
      "endMs": 965460
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "I really can't.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 966060,
      "endMs": 968220
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "Say, sport, mind if I have the next dance?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 972300,
      "endMs": 975020
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "What the...? Don't sneak up on a... Aren't you...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 975220,
      "endMs": 978060
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "No need for the blown gasket, Charlie. I'll have her back in one piece.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 978260,
      "endMs": 982900
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "But in the end, just when things looked worst, true love triumphed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 995300,
      "endMs": 1000020
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Do you, Jacqueline Bouvier, take this man...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1002140,
      "endMs": 1005380
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "...to be your lawfully wedded husband?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1005580,
      "endMs": 1008620
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Oh, Monty, my favorite song. How did...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1008860,
      "endMs": 1011820
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "I specifically requested no romantic music. What...?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1011980,
      "endMs": 1014740
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Mrs. Bouvier!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014940,
      "endMs": 1017460
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "Mrs. Bouvier!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1017620,
      "endMs": 1020420
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Mrs. Bouvier!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1021860,
      "endMs": 1024420
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "Honey, are you sure you wanna be Mrs. Montgomery Burns?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1024620,
      "endMs": 1027980
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "Wouldn't you rather be Mrs. Abraham J. Simpson?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028180,
      "endMs": 1032620
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "No.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1032820,
      "endMs": 1034140
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "I don't wanna be either. Hot diggety damn!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1035460,
      "endMs": 1037980
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "That's good enough for me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1038140,
      "endMs": 1040220
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "That doesn't seem like a happy ending.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1055640,
      "endMs": 1057360
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "That seems more like a detached tale of modern alienation.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1057720,
      "endMs": 1060720
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "I give up. Did anybody learn anything about love tonight?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060920,
      "endMs": 1065080
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Yeah, learned it screws everybody up.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1065240,
      "endMs": 1067200
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Well, there's that side of it. But there's also...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1067400,
      "endMs": 1071320
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Help me out here, Lisa.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1071520,
      "endMs": 1072920
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "Sorry, Mom. I've decided to save my love...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073120,
      "endMs": 1075040
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "...for someone who's guaranteed not to reject me. Soon, Cory, soon.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1075240,
      "endMs": 1079320
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "Well, kids, I tried.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1083400,
      "endMs": 1086320
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "But maybe you're right. Wait a minute, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086520,
      "endMs": 1088840
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "Love isn't hopeless. Look, maybe I'm no expert on the subject...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1089040,
      "endMs": 1092920
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "...but there was one time I got it right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1093120,
      "endMs": 1095920
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "Artie, I don't know. It was a beautiful evening. Let's not ruin it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1096080,
      "endMs": 1100840
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Just this. Artie, please.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1101000,
      "endMs": 1103360
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "Come on, kiss me. Please. No, really, I mean it! Now stop it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1103520,
      "endMs": 1108280
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "I'm sorry, Marge. Take me home.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1110160,
      "endMs": 1112720
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "I'd appreciate it if you didn't tell anybody about my busy hands.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1123360,
      "endMs": 1127480
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "Not so much for myself, but I'm so respected...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1127760,
      "endMs": 1130840
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "...it would damage the town to hear it. Good night.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1131040,
      "endMs": 1135040
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "Yeah, right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1135240,
      "endMs": 1136800
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "Shut up! I'm over as far as I can go!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1141880,
      "endMs": 1145720
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "All right! All right! I'll walk in the mud!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1145960,
      "endMs": 1150480
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "Homer? Marge?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1151560,
      "endMs": 1153000
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Yeah. You want a ride? Sure.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1153200,
      "endMs": 1155720
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "When I got home, I realized who I should've gone with.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158420,
      "endMs": 1162620
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Who?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1162820,
      "endMs": 1164660
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "Hi, prom date. Marge, pour vous.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1164860,
      "endMs": 1169140
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "Why so glum? I got a problem.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171500,
      "endMs": 1174940
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "Once you stop this car, I'm gonna hug you and kiss you...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1176140,
      "endMs": 1180140
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "...and I'll never let you go.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1180340,
      "endMs": 1182660
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "Your first kiss.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183460,
      "endMs": 1185300
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "But not the last.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1185540,
      "endMs": 1187660
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202220,
      "endMs": 1204540
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "See, kids? That's what I meant by romance. www.tvsubtitles.net",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1207660,
      "endMs": 2000
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
